i-finance/hypoteky/americka-hypoteka\";const MONETA_AMERICAN_PRODUCT=\"https://www.moneta.cz/hypoteky/americka-hypoteka\";const UC_RATE_SHEET=\"https://www.unicreditbank.cz/cs/ostatni/urokove-sazby.html\";const CNB_INVESTMENT_DEFINITION=\"Investi\\u010Dn\\xED hypot\\xE9kou se rozum\\xED hypote\\u010Dn\\xED \\xFAv\\u011Br poskytnut\\xFD za \\xFA\\u010Delem po\\u0159\\xEDzen\\xED t\\u0159et\\xED a dal\\u0161\\xED obytn\\xE9 nemovitosti anebo za \\xFA\\u010Delem po\\u0159\\xEDzen\\xED obytn\\xE9 nemovitosti ur\\u010Den\\xE9 k pron\\xE1jmu.\";const wave1CommercialLandings=[{slug:\"refinancovani\",title:\"Refinancov\\xE1n\\xED hypot\\xE9ky: sazby, v\\xFDpo\\u010Det a postup | Hypot\\xE9ka Jasn\\u011B\",description:\"Pr\\u016Fvodce refinancov\\xE1n\\xEDm: rozd\\xEDl oproti refixaci, na\\u010Dasov\\xE1n\\xED konce fixace, n\\xE1klady p\\u0159evodu a srovn\\xE1n\\xED sc\\xE9n\\xE1\\u0159\\u016F. Zve\\u0159ejn\\u011Bn\\xE9 sazby pro refinancov\\xE1n\\xED bez slibu \\xFAspory.\",h1:\"Refinancov\\xE1n\\xED hypot\\xE9ky\",lead:\"Refinancov\\xE1n\\xED znamen\\xE1 p\\u0159evod hypot\\xE9ky k jin\\xE9 bance nebo novou smlouvu u st\\xE1vaj\\xEDc\\xED \\u2014 ne v\\u017Edy je to lep\\u0161\\xED ne\\u017E refixace. Tento pr\\u016Fvodce v\\xE1s provede \\u010D\\xEDsly, n\\xE1klady a na\\u010Dasov\\xE1n\\xEDm bez slib\\u016F \\u201Enejlevn\\u011Bj\\u0161\\xED sazby\\u201C.\",audience:\"Klienti s b\\u011B\\u017E\\xEDc\\xED hypot\\xE9kou bl\\xEDzko konce fixace nebo s v\\xFDrazn\\u011B vy\\u0161\\u0161\\xED sazbou ne\\u017E aktu\\xE1ln\\xED trh.\",authorId:\"redakce-hj\",publishedAt:\"2026-07-15\",updatedAt:\"2026-08-11\",commercialIntent:\"refinance\",primaryCta:{label:\"Prov\\u011B\\u0159it refinancov\\xE1n\\xED\",href:`${import_routes.routes.sazby}?purpose=refinance`},secondaryCta:{label:\"Nez\\xE1vazn\\xE1 popt\\xE1vka\",href:\"#poptavka\"},quickAnswer:{heading:\"Refinancov\\xE1n\\xED v kostce\",bullets:[\"Refinancov\\xE1n\\xED = p\\u0159evod \\xFAv\\u011Bru; refixace = nov\\xE1 sazba u stejn\\xE9 banky.\",\"Za\\u010Dn\\u011Bte \\u0159e\\u0161it 3\\u20136 m\\u011Bs\\xEDc\\u016F p\\u0159ed koncem fixace \\u2014 odhad a dokumenty trvaj\\xED.\",\"Porovn\\xE1vejte RPSN, poji\\u0161t\\u011Bn\\xED a poplatky, ne jen nomin\\xE1ln\\xED sazbu.\",\"Zve\\u0159ejn\\u011Bn\\xE9 sazby pro refinancov\\xE1n\\xED najdete na /sazby \\u2014 nejsou z\\xE1vazn\\xE1 nab\\xEDdka.\"]},showLeadCapture:true,sections:[{id:\"refinancovani-vs-refixace\",heading:\"Co je refinancov\\xE1n\\xED vs. refixace\",paragraphs:[\"Refixace je zm\\u011Bna \\xFArokov\\xE9 sazby (a \\u010Dasto podm\\xEDnek) u st\\xE1vaj\\xEDc\\xED banky na z\\xE1klad\\u011B st\\xE1vaj\\xEDc\\xED smlouvy. Refinancov\\xE1n\\xED znamen\\xE1 p\\u0159evod z\\u016Fstatku dluhu k jin\\xE9 instituci \\u2014 nebo n\\u011Bkdy novou smlouvu u stejn\\xE9 banky s jin\\xFDm produktem.\",\"Marketing \\u010Dasto m\\xEDch\\xE1 oba pojmy. Pro v\\xE1s rozhoduje, zda z\\u016Fstat u st\\xE1vaj\\xEDc\\xED smlouvy s novou fixac\\xED, nebo n\\xE9st n\\xE1klady p\\u0159evodu v\\xFDm\\u011Bnou za lep\\u0161\\xED podm\\xEDnky. Ob\\u011B cesty mohou b\\xFDt rozumn\\xE9 \\u2014 z\\xE1le\\u017E\\xED na \\u010D\\xEDslech, ne na sloganu.\"]},{id:\"kdy-zacit\",heading:\"Kdy za\\u010D\\xEDt \\u0159e\\u0161it konec fixace\",paragraphs:[\"Ide\\xE1ln\\u011B 3\\u20136 m\\u011Bs\\xEDc\\u016F p\\u0159ed koncem fixace. Banka pot\\u0159ebuje odhad nemovitosti, v\\xFDpisy, potvrzen\\xED p\\u0159\\xEDjmu a \\u010Das na schv\\xE1len\\xED. Tlak v posledn\\xEDch t\\xFDdnech \\u010Dasto vede k prvn\\xED nab\\xEDdce bez srovn\\xE1n\\xED.\",\"N\\u011Bkter\\xE9 smlouvy umo\\u017E\\u0148uj\\xED p\\u0159ed\\u010Dasnou zm\\u011Bnu \\u2014 v\\u017Edy ov\\u011B\\u0159te sankce za p\\u0159ed\\u010Dasn\\xE9 splacen\\xED mimo konec fixace v konkr\\xE9tn\\xED smlouv\\u011B, ne v obecn\\xE9m \\u010Dl\\xE1nku.\"],bullets:[\"Zapi\\u0161te si datum konce fixace do kalend\\xE1\\u0159e.\",\"Po\\u017E\\xE1dejte st\\xE1vaj\\xEDc\\xED banku o nab\\xEDdku refixace p\\xEDsemn\\u011B.\",\"Paraleln\\u011B modelujte sc\\xE9n\\xE1\\u0159 p\\u0159evodu \\u2014 a\\u017E pak rozhodujte.\"]},{id:\"co-potrebujete-znat\",heading:\"Co pot\\u0159ebujete zn\\xE1t p\\u0159ed rozhodnut\\xEDm\",paragraphs:[\"Z\\u016Fstatek jistiny, aktu\\xE1ln\\xED sazba a zb\\xFDvaj\\xEDc\\xED fixace, p\\u016Fvodn\\xED splatnost a zb\\xFDvaj\\xEDc\\xED roky, m\\u011Bs\\xED\\u010Dn\\xED spl\\xE1tka v\\u010Detn\\u011B poji\\u0161t\\u011Bn\\xED a poplatk\\u016F v\\xE1zan\\xFDch na \\xFAv\\u011Br.\",\"Bez t\\u011Bchto \\u010D\\xEDsel nelze f\\xE9rov\\u011B porovnat \\u201Ez\\u016Fstat\\u201C vs. \\u201Erefinancovat\\u201C. Banka v\\xE1m je poskytne na vy\\u017E\\xE1d\\xE1n\\xED; n\\u011Bkter\\xE9 \\xFAdaje najdete v internetov\\xE9m bankovnictv\\xED nebo ro\\u010Dn\\xEDm p\\u0159ehledu.\"]},{id:\"sazba-a-splatka\",heading:\"Jak zm\\u011Bna sazby m\\u011Bn\\xED spl\\xE1tku\",paragraphs:[\"P\\u0159i stejn\\xE9 splatnosti a z\\u016Fstatku sn\\xED\\u017Een\\xED sazby o 0,5 p.b. typicky sn\\xED\\u017E\\xED spl\\xE1tku \\u2014 ale ne v\\u017Edy to pokryje n\\xE1klady p\\u0159evodu v prvn\\xEDch letech. Orienta\\u010Dn\\xED model najdete v hypote\\u010Dn\\xED kalkula\\u010Dce; v\\xFDsledek nen\\xED nab\\xEDdka banky.\",\"Modelujte i sc\\xE9n\\xE1\\u0159 r\\u016Fstu sazby po nov\\xE9 fixaci. Kr\\xE1tk\\xE1 fixace s nejni\\u017E\\u0161\\xED sazbou m\\u016F\\u017Ee b\\xFDt dra\\u017E\\u0161\\xED strategie, pokud o\\u010Dek\\xE1v\\xE1te volatilitu \\xFArok\\u016F.\"],bullets:[\"Spo\\u010D\\xEDtejte spl\\xE1tku p\\u0159i sou\\u010Dasn\\xE9m z\\u016Fstatku a nov\\xE9 sazb\\u011B.\",\"P\\u0159idejte n\\xE1klady p\\u0159evodu a rozd\\u011Blte je po m\\u011Bs\\xEDc\\xEDch fixace.\",\"Porovnejte s nab\\xEDdkou refixace u st\\xE1vaj\\xEDc\\xED banky.\"]},{id:\"naklady-a-podminky\",heading:\"N\\xE1klady a podm\\xEDnky p\\u0159evodu\",paragraphs:[\"Typicky vstupuj\\xED odhad nemovitosti, poplatek za vklad z\\xE1stavn\\xEDho pr\\xE1va v katastru, not\\xE1\\u0159 (pokud je pot\\u0159eba), p\\u0159\\xEDpadn\\u011B poplatek za p\\u0159ed\\u010Dasn\\xE9 splacen\\xED u st\\xE1vaj\\xEDc\\xED banky mimo konec fixace.\",\"Nov\\xE1 smlouva m\\u016F\\u017Ee vy\\u017Eadovat jin\\xE9 poji\\u0161t\\u011Bn\\xED nemovitosti nebo schopnosti spl\\xE1cet \\u2014 porovnejte ro\\u010Dn\\xED n\\xE1klady, ne jen jednor\\xE1zov\\xE9 poplatky.\"]},{id:\"proc-nestaci-sazba\",heading:\"Pro\\u010D nesta\\u010D\\xED nomin\\xE1ln\\xED sazba\",paragraphs:[\"RPSN zahrnuje poplatky a n\\u011Bkter\\xE9 vedlej\\u0161\\xED n\\xE1klady \\u2014 u refinancov\\xE1n\\xED rozhoduje o skute\\u010Dn\\xE9 drahot\\u011B \\xFAv\\u011Bru. Poji\\u0161t\\u011Bn\\xED v\\xE1zan\\xE9 na \\xFAv\\u011Br m\\u016F\\u017Ee rozd\\xEDl mezi dv\\u011Bma nab\\xEDdkami zcela smazat.\",\"Srovn\\xE1vejte stejnou d\\xE9lku fixace a stejn\\xFD z\\u016Fstatek. Ni\\u017E\\u0161\\xED sazba p\\u0159i krat\\u0161\\xED fixaci nen\\xED automaticky lep\\u0161\\xED volba pro ka\\u017Ed\\xE9ho.\"]},{id:\"postup-prevodu\",heading:\"Postup p\\u0159evodu krok za krokem\",paragraphs:[\"1) Seberte \\u010D\\xEDsla ze st\\xE1vaj\\xEDc\\xED smlouvy. 2) Po\\u017E\\xE1dejte o refixaci u st\\xE1vaj\\xEDc\\xED banky. 3) Paraleln\\u011B z\\xEDskejte orienta\\u010Dn\\xED sazby pro refinancov\\xE1n\\xED na /sazby. 4) Spo\\u010D\\xEDtejte sc\\xE9n\\xE1\\u0159e v kalkula\\u010Dce. 5) Teprve pak \\u017E\\xE1dejte o z\\xE1vaznou nab\\xEDdku u vybran\\xE9 banky.\",\"P\\u0159evod obvykle vy\\u017Eaduje nov\\xFD odhad, schv\\xE1len\\xED a vklad z\\xE1stavn\\xEDho pr\\xE1va. Pl\\xE1nujte \\u010Das \\u2014 nen\\xED to z\\xE1le\\u017Eitost jednoho t\\xFDdne.\"]},{id:\"kdy-zustat\",heading:\"Kdy z\\u016Fstat u st\\xE1vaj\\xEDc\\xED banky\",paragraphs:[\"Refixace m\\u016F\\u017Ee b\\xFDt levn\\u011Bj\\u0161\\xED ne\\u017E p\\u0159evod, pokud n\\xE1klady katastru a odhadu se nevr\\xE1t\\xED b\\u011Bhem pl\\xE1novan\\xE9 fixace. N\\u011Bkter\\xE9 banky nab\\xEDdnou konkurenceschopnou sazbu klient\\u016Fm, kte\\u0159\\xED maj\\xED srovn\\xE1n\\xED od jinde.\",\"Z\\u016Fstat d\\xE1v\\xE1 smysl i p\\u0159i kr\\xE1tk\\xE9m horizontu prodeje nemovitosti nebo kdy\\u017E nov\\xE1 banka neuzn\\xE1 v\\xE1\\u0161 p\\u0159\\xEDjem stejn\\u011B p\\u0159\\xEDzniv\\u011B. Rozhodnut\\xED nen\\xED ideologick\\xE9 \\u2014 je aritmetick\\xE9.\"]},{id:\"data-a-transparentnost\",heading:\"Data a transparentnost sazeb\",paragraphs:[\"Na str\\xE1nce /sazby zve\\u0159ej\\u0148ujeme sazby bank pro \\xFA\\u010Del refinancov\\xE1n\\xED (purpose=refinance), kde m\\xE1me ov\\u011B\\u0159en\\xFD prim\\xE1rn\\xED zdroj. Ne v\\u0161echny banky maj\\xED ve\\u0159ejn\\u011B stejn\\u011B detailn\\xED cen\\xEDk \\u2014 u \\u010D\\xE1sti sc\\xE9n\\xE1\\u0159\\u016F pracujeme s ov\\u011B\\u0159en\\xFDmi, ale omezen\\xFDmi daty a to uv\\xE1d\\xEDme.\",\"Zve\\u0159ejn\\u011Bn\\xE1 sazba nen\\xED z\\xE1vazn\\xE1 nab\\xEDdka pro va\\u0161i nemovitost. Fin\\xE1ln\\xED podm\\xEDnky z\\xE1vis\\xED na LTV, p\\u0159\\xEDjmu, scoringu a intern\\xED metodice banky.\"]}],faqs:[{question:\"Mus\\xEDm refinancovat hned po konci fixace?\",answer:\"Ne. M\\u016F\\u017Eete refixovat u st\\xE1vaj\\xEDc\\xED banky nebo refinancovat pozd\\u011Bji \\u2014 z\\xE1le\\u017E\\xED na smlouv\\u011B a n\\xE1kladech. Rozhodujte podle sc\\xE9n\\xE1\\u0159\\u016F, ne podle reklam.\"},{question:\"Kolik u\\u0161et\\u0159\\xEDm refinancov\\xE1n\\xEDm?\",answer:\"Nelze sl\\xEDbit univerz\\xE1ln\\xED \\xFAsporu. Z\\xE1le\\u017E\\xED na rozd\\xEDlu sazeb, z\\u016Fstatku, n\\xE1kladech p\\u0159evodu a poji\\u0161t\\u011Bn\\xED. Spo\\u010D\\xEDtejte si oba sc\\xE9n\\xE1\\u0159e v kalkula\\u010Dce.\"},{question:\"Sta\\u010D\\xED porovnat jen \\xFArokovou sazbu?\",answer:\"Ne. RPSN, poji\\u0161t\\u011Bn\\xED, poplatky a d\\xE9lka fixace \\u010Dasto rozhodnou v\\xEDc ne\\u017E desetina procenta na sazb\\u011B.\"},{question:\"Jsou sazby na /sazby z\\xE1vazn\\xE9?\",answer:\"Ne. Jde o zve\\u0159ejn\\u011Bn\\xE9 informace z prim\\xE1rn\\xEDch zdroj\\u016F bank. Va\\u0161e nab\\xEDdka m\\u016F\\u017Ee b\\xFDt jin\\xE1 podle profilu a nemovitosti.\"}],sources:[{label:\"\\u010Cl\\xE1nek: Refinancov\\xE1n\\xED po fixaci \\u2014 checklist\",url:`${import_routes.routes.clanky}/refinancovani-po-fixaci-checklist`},{label:\"Akademie: Fixace\",url:`${import_routes.routes.akademie}/fixace`},{label:\"\\u010CNB \\u2014 makroobez\\u0159etnostn\\xED politika\",url:CNB_MACRO,note:\"R\\xE1mec LTV/DTI/DSTI v \\u010Dase; ov\\u011B\\u0159te aktu\\xE1ln\\xED zn\\u011Bn\\xED.\"},{label:\"Zve\\u0159ejn\\u011Bn\\xE9 sazby pro refinancov\\xE1n\\xED\",url:`${import_routes.routes.sazby}?purpose=refinance`},{label:\"Metodika dat Hypot\\xE9ka Jasn\\u011B\",url:import_routes.routes.metodika}],relatedTools:[{label:\"Sazby pro refinancov\\xE1n\\xED\",href:`${import_routes.routes.sazby}?purpose=refinance`},{label:\"Hypote\\u010Dn\\xED kalkula\\u010Dka\",href:import_routes.routes.kalkulacky.hypotecniKalkulacka},{label:\"Zjistit moje mo\\u017Enosti\",href:import_routes.routes.mojeMoznosti}],relatedArticles:[{label:\"Refinancov\\xE1n\\xED po fixaci \\u2014 checklist\",href:`${import_routes.routes.clanky}/refinancovani-po-fixaci-checklist`}],relatedAcademy:[{label:\"Fixace\",href:`${import_routes.routes.akademie}/fixace`},{label:\"RPSN\",href:`${import_routes.routes.akademie}/rpsn`}]},{slug:\"hypoteka-osvc\",title:\"Hypot\\xE9ka pro OSV\\u010C: p\\u0159\\xEDjmy, doklady a mo\\u017Enosti | Hypot\\xE9ka Jasn\\u011B\",description:\"Jak OSV\\u010C dokl\\xE1daj\\xED p\\u0159\\xEDjem k hypot\\xE9ce: da\\u0148ov\\xE9 p\\u0159izn\\xE1n\\xED, pau\\u0161\\xE1ln\\xED v\\xFDdaje i pau\\u0161\\xE1ln\\xED da\\u0148. Metodiky bank se li\\u0161\\xED \\u2014 bez vymy\\u0161len\\xFDch koeficient\\u016F.\",h1:\"Hypot\\xE9ka pro OSV\\u010C\",lead:\"Banky pou\\u017E\\xEDvaj\\xED vlastn\\xED underwriting. Uznan\\xFD p\\u0159\\xEDjem OSV\\u010C m\\u016F\\u017Ee vych\\xE1zet z da\\u0148ov\\xE9ho z\\xE1kladu / zisku, da\\u0148ov\\xE9 historie, historie podnik\\xE1n\\xED, nebo \\u2014 pokud to banka v\\xFDslovn\\u011B umo\\u017E\\u0148uje \\u2014 z obratov\\xE9 metodiky. P\\u0159ipravte dokumenty a realistick\\xFD strop spl\\xE1tky d\\u0159\\xEDv, ne\\u017E rezervujete nemovitost.\",audience:\"OSV\\u010C, freelancery a majitel\\xE9 jednoosobov\\xFDch \\u017Eivnost\\xED v \\u010CR s p\\u0159\\xEDjmem z podnik\\xE1n\\xED.\",authorId:\"redakce-hj\",publishedAt:\"2026-07-15\",updatedAt:\"2026-08-11\",commercialIntent:\"osvc\",primaryCta:{label:\"Prov\\u011B\\u0159it hypot\\xE9ku pro OSV\\u010C\",href:\"#poptavka\"},secondaryCta:{label:\"Spustit diagnostiku\",href:`${import_routes.routes.mojeMoznosti}?intent=osvc`},quickAnswer:{heading:\"OSV\\u010C a hypot\\xE9ka v kostce\",bullets:[\"Metodika uzn\\xE1n\\xED p\\u0159\\xEDjmu se li\\u0161\\xED banka od banky \\u2014 neexistuje jedna univerz\\xE1ln\\xED formule.\",\"\\u010Casto vstupuje da\\u0148ov\\xE1 historie; u n\\u011Bkter\\xFDch produkt\\u016F i obratov\\xE1 / transak\\u010Dn\\xED metoda.\",\"Po\\u017Eadovan\\xE9 doklady (po\\u010Det da\\u0148ov\\xFDch p\\u0159izn\\xE1n\\xED, v\\xFDpisy) se li\\u0161\\xED \\u2014 ov\\u011B\\u0159te u konkr\\xE9tn\\xED banky.\",\"Diagnostika na /moje-moznosti pom\\u016F\\u017Ee s orientac\\xED, ne se schv\\xE1len\\xEDm.\"]},showLeadCapture:true,sections:[{id:\"kdo-je-to-pro\",heading:\"Pro koho je tento pr\\u016Fvodce\",paragraphs:[\"Pro \\u017Eadatele s p\\u0159\\xEDjmem z OSV\\u010C v \\u010CR \\u2014 a\\u0165 u\\u017E jste na vedlej\\u0161\\xED \\u010Dinnost, na hlavn\\xED \\u017Eivnost, nebo p\\u0159ech\\xE1z\\xEDte ze zam\\u011Bstn\\xE1n\\xED. Spole\\u010Dn\\xE1 \\u017E\\xE1dost s partnerem se zam\\u011Bstnaneck\\xFDm p\\u0159\\xEDjmem m\\u011Bn\\xED kapacitu \\xFAv\\u011Bru.\",\"Pr\\u016Fvodce ne\\u0159e\\u0161\\xED firemn\\xED \\xFAv\\u011Bry s.r.o. \\u2014 tam plat\\xED jin\\xE1 pravidla a \\xFA\\u010Detnictv\\xED. Zam\\u011B\\u0159ujeme se na fyzick\\xE9 osoby podnikaj\\xEDc\\xED.\"]},{id:\"jak-dokladat-prijem\",heading:\"Jak se dokl\\xE1d\\xE1 a uzn\\xE1v\\xE1 p\\u0159\\xEDjem\",paragraphs:[\"Banky pou\\u017E\\xEDvaj\\xED vlastn\\xED underwriting. Podle banky a dolo\\u017Een\\xE9 situace m\\u016F\\u017Ee uznan\\xFD p\\u0159\\xEDjem OSV\\u010C vych\\xE1zet z da\\u0148ov\\xE9ho z\\xE1kladu / zisku, da\\u0148ov\\xE9 historie, historie podnik\\xE1n\\xED, obratov\\xE9 / transak\\u010Dn\\xED metodiky tam, kde ji banka v\\xFDslovn\\u011B umo\\u017E\\u0148uje, nebo z jin\\xE9 zve\\u0159ejn\\u011Bn\\xE9 metodiky.\",\"Hrub\\xFD obrat na faktur\\xE1ch proto nen\\xED automaticky \\u201Ep\\u0159\\xEDjem pro spl\\xE1tky\\u201C. Z\\xE1rove\\u0148 ale neplat\\xED absolutn\\xED tvrzen\\xED, \\u017Ee banka obrat nikdy neposuzuje \\u2014 z\\xE1le\\u017E\\xED na produktu a metodice.\"]},{id:\"priklady-bank\",heading:\"P\\u0159\\xEDklady zve\\u0159ejn\\u011Bn\\xFDch po\\u017Eadavk\\u016F bank\",paragraphs:[\"Komer\\u010Dn\\xED banka na str\\xE1nce \\u017D\\xE1dost o hypot\\xE9ku uv\\xE1d\\xED, \\u017Ee podnikatel dokl\\xE1d\\xE1 da\\u0148ov\\xE9 p\\u0159izn\\xE1n\\xED za posledn\\xED 2 roky (zam\\u011Bstnanec formul\\xE1\\u0159em Potvrzen\\xED o p\\u0159\\xEDjmu). Jde o po\\u017Eadavek konkr\\xE9tn\\xED banky \\u2014 ne o univerz\\xE1ln\\xED pravidlo trhu.\",\"Ve ve\\u0159ejn\\xE9 Metodice hypote\\u010Dn\\xEDch \\xFAv\\u011Br\\u016F KB banka popisuje v\\xFDpo\\u010Det \\u010Dist\\xE9ho p\\u0159\\xEDjmu z podnik\\xE1n\\xED (kalkula\\u010Dka DP / pau\\u0161\\xE1ln\\xED da\\u0148) a ve vybran\\xFDch p\\u0159\\xEDpadech i obratovou metodu s v\\xFDpisy z podnikatelsk\\xE9ho \\xFA\\u010Dtu (nap\\u0159. v\\xFDpisy za posledn\\xED 3 m\\u011Bs\\xEDce plus v\\xFDpis za 6. m\\u011Bs\\xEDc p\\u0159ed \\u017E\\xE1dost\\xED u pau\\u0161\\xE1ln\\xED dan\\u011B). Koeficienty a p\\u0159esn\\xE9 p\\u0159epo\\u010Dty bez aktu\\xE1ln\\xEDho ov\\u011B\\u0159en\\xED u banky neuv\\xE1d\\xEDme.\"],bullets:[\"KB (ve\\u0159ejn\\xE1 podpora): da\\u0148ov\\xE9 p\\u0159izn\\xE1n\\xED podnikatele za posledn\\xED 2 roky.\",\"KB (metodika): da\\u0148ov\\xFD z\\xE1klad / pau\\u0161\\xE1ln\\xED da\\u0148; ve vybran\\xFDch p\\u0159\\xEDpadech obratov\\xE1 metoda.\",\"Jin\\xE1 banka m\\u016F\\u017Ee cht\\xEDt jin\\xFD po\\u010Det let DP nebo jin\\xE9 v\\xFDpisy \\u2014 ov\\u011B\\u0159te prim\\xE1rn\\xED zdroj.\"]},{id:\"danove-rezimy\",heading:\"Da\\u0148ov\\xE9 p\\u0159izn\\xE1n\\xED vs. v\\xFDdajov\\xFD pau\\u0161\\xE1l vs. pau\\u0161\\xE1ln\\xED da\\u0148\",paragraphs:[\"U skute\\u010Dn\\xFDch v\\xFDdaj\\u016F banka \\u010Dasto pracuje s \\xFA\\u010Detn\\xEDm ziskem. U v\\xFDdajov\\xE9ho pau\\u0161\\xE1lu se da\\u0148ov\\xFD z\\xE1klad sni\\u017Euje podle z\\xE1konn\\xFDch pau\\u0161\\xE1ln\\xEDch sazeb \\u2014 uznan\\xFD p\\u0159\\xEDjem pak m\\u016F\\u017Ee b\\xFDt v\\xFDrazn\\u011B ni\\u017E\\u0161\\xED ne\\u017E cash-flow.\",\"U pau\\u0161\\xE1ln\\xED dan\\u011B maj\\xED banky specifick\\xE1 pravidla. Konkr\\xE9tn\\xED koeficienty a p\\u0159epo\\u010Dty se li\\u0161\\xED banka od banky \\u2014 bez aktu\\xE1ln\\xEDho ov\\u011B\\u0159en\\xE9ho prim\\xE1rn\\xEDho d\\u016Fkazu je neuv\\xE1d\\xEDme.\"],bullets:[\"Nejd\\u0159\\xEDv zjist\\u011Bte, co konkr\\xE9tn\\xED banka uzn\\xE1 z va\\u0161eho da\\u0148ov\\xE9ho re\\u017Eimu.\",\"Modelujte konzervativn\\u011B \\u2014 ne podle nejlep\\u0161\\xEDho m\\u011Bs\\xEDce.\",\"Spole\\u010Dn\\xE1 \\u017E\\xE1dost m\\u016F\\u017Ee zm\\u011Bnit kapacitu spl\\xE1tek (intern\\xED test banky).\"]},{id:\"historie-podnikani\",heading:\"Historie podnik\\xE1n\\xED a stabilita\",paragraphs:[\"Banky \\u010Dasto preferuj\\xED uzav\\u0159en\\xE9 da\\u0148ov\\xE9 obdob\\xED; po\\u010Det let a p\\u0159\\xEDsnost se li\\u0161\\xED produkt od produktu. V\\xFDkyvy tr\\u017Eeb, nov\\xE1 \\u017Eivnost nebo p\\u0159echod z zam\\u011Bstn\\xE1n\\xED zvy\\u0161uj\\xED nejistotu posouzen\\xED.\",\"Pokud pl\\xE1nujete hypot\\xE9ku, stabilizujte cash-flow a dokumentaci d\\u0159\\xEDv, ne\\u017E pod\\xE1te \\u017E\\xE1dost. N\\xE1hl\\xFD n\\xE1r\\u016Fst fakturace t\\u011Bsn\\u011B p\\u0159ed \\u017E\\xE1dost\\xED nemus\\xED banku p\\u0159esv\\u011Bd\\u010Dit.\"]},{id:\"typicke-doklady\",heading:\"Doklady \\u2014 obecn\\u011B, ne univerz\\xE1ln\\u011B\",paragraphs:[\"\\u010Casto se objevuj\\xED da\\u0148ov\\xE1 p\\u0159izn\\xE1n\\xED v\\u010Detn\\u011B p\\u0159\\xEDloh, doklad o zaplacen\\xED dan\\u011B / bezdlu\\u017Enosti, p\\u0159ehledy pojistn\\xE9ho, v\\xFDpisy z podnikatelsk\\xE9ho \\xFA\\u010Dtu a standardn\\xED dokumenty k nemovitosti. P\\u0159esn\\xFD seznam a d\\xE9lka historie v\\xFDpis\\u016F se li\\u0161\\xED podle banky \\u2014 neplat\\xED jedno univerz\\xE1ln\\xED \\u201E6\\u201312 m\\u011Bs\\xEDc\\u016F v\\xFDpis\\u016F\\u201C ani \\u201Ev\\u017Edy dv\\u011B p\\u0159izn\\xE1n\\xED\\u201C pro cel\\xFD trh.\",\"Banka m\\u016F\\u017Ee po\\u017Eadovat i smlouvy s hlavn\\xEDmi odb\\u011Brateli nebo potvrzen\\xED o d\\xE9lce spolupr\\xE1ce \\u2014 z\\xE1le\\u017E\\xED na oboru a riziku. Seznam si ov\\u011B\\u0159te u konkr\\xE9tn\\xED banky.\"]},{id:\"spoluzadatel\",heading:\"Spolu\\u017Eadatel a kombinace p\\u0159\\xEDjm\\u016F\",paragraphs:[\"Partner se zam\\u011Bstnaneck\\xFDm p\\u0159\\xEDjmem \\u010Dasto zv\\xFD\\u0161\\xED kapacitu \\xFAv\\u011Bru \\u2014 banka posuzuje dom\\xE1cnost dohromady. Naopak z\\xE1vazky partnera sni\\u017Euj\\xED kapacitu stejn\\u011B jako va\\u0161e.\",\"Spole\\u010Dn\\xE1 \\u017E\\xE1dost nen\\xED automatick\\xE1 v\\xFDhra: oba mus\\xEDte proj\\xEDt scoringem a dokumentac\\xED.\"]},{id:\"co-banky-posuzuji\",heading:\"Co banky posuzuj\\xED \\u2014 ov\\u011B\\u0159en\\xE1 fakta vs. nejistota\",paragraphs:[\"Fakt: banka pracuje s dolo\\u017Een\\xFDm p\\u0159\\xEDjmem dle sv\\xE9 metodiky, z\\xE1vazky, LTV a scoringem. Makroobez\\u0159etnostn\\xED r\\xE1mec \\u010CNB (LTV; DTI/DSTI dle aktu\\xE1ln\\xEDho nastaven\\xED) se vztahuje na standardn\\xED hypot\\xE9ky stejn\\u011B jako u zam\\u011Bstnanc\\u016F \\u2014 stav DTI/DSTI ov\\u011B\\u0159te u \\u010CNB.\",\"Bez konkr\\xE9tn\\xED banky nejist\\xE9: p\\u0159esn\\xFD p\\u0159epo\\u010Det pau\\u0161\\xE1ln\\xEDch v\\xFDdaj\\u016F, podm\\xEDnky obratov\\xE9 metody, v\\xFDjimky pro mlad\\xE9 podnikatele nebo specifick\\xE1 odv\\u011Btv\\xED. Tyto parametry se m\\u011Bn\\xED a li\\u0161\\xED produkt od produktu.\"]},{id:\"dalsi-krok\",heading:\"Dal\\u0161\\xED krok: diagnostika\",paragraphs:[\"Orienta\\u010Dn\\xED diagnostika na /moje-moznosti?intent=osvc v\\xE1m pom\\u016F\\u017Ee se\\u0159adit priority \\u2014 dokumenty, rezervu spl\\xE1tky, LTV. Typ da\\u0148ov\\xE9ho re\\u017Eimu zvol\\xEDte v diagnostice. V\\xFDsledek nen\\xED schv\\xE1len\\xED \\xFAv\\u011Bru.\",\"A\\u017E budete m\\xEDt realistick\\xFD strop spl\\xE1tky, d\\xE1v\\xE1 smysl porovnat ov\\u011B\\u0159en\\xE9 sazby na /sazby a p\\u0159ipravit se na konkr\\xE9tn\\xED banku.\"]}],faqs:[{question:\"Sta\\u010D\\xED v\\xFDpis z \\xFA\\u010Dtu za t\\u0159i m\\u011Bs\\xEDce?\",answer:\"Z\\xE1le\\u017E\\xED na bance a metodice. N\\u011Bkter\\xE9 produkty vy\\u017Eaduj\\xED da\\u0148ovou historii; jinde v\\xFDpisy dopl\\u0148uj\\xED nebo v omezen\\xFDch p\\u0159\\xEDpadech podporuj\\xED obratovou metodu. V\\xFDpisy obvykle nenahrazuj\\xED da\\u0148ov\\xE1 p\\u0159izn\\xE1n\\xED, pokud je banka vy\\u017Eaduje.\"},{question:\"Banka uzn\\xE1 cel\\xFD m\\u016Fj obrat?\",answer:\"Neautomaticky. Uzn\\xE1van\\xFD p\\u0159\\xEDjem z\\xE1vis\\xED na metodice banky \\u2014 da\\u0148ov\\xFD z\\xE1klad / zisk, historie, p\\u0159\\xEDpadn\\u011B obratov\\xE1 metoda tam, kde ji banka v\\xFDslovn\\u011B umo\\u017E\\u0148uje. Obrat na faktu\\u0159e nen\\xED tot\\xE9\\u017E co uznan\\xFD p\\u0159\\xEDjem.\"},{question:\"Pom\\u016F\\u017Ee pau\\u0161\\xE1ln\\xED da\\u0148?\",answer:\"Z\\xE1le\\u017E\\xED na p\\xE1smu a bance. N\\u011Bkter\\xE9 banky maj\\xED specifick\\xE9 p\\u0159epo\\u010Dty, jin\\xE9 posuzuj\\xED p\\u0159\\xEDsn\\u011Bji. Bez ov\\u011B\\u0159en\\xED u konkr\\xE9tn\\xED banky nepl\\xE1nujte optimisticky.\"},{question:\"Kolik let podnik\\xE1n\\xED banka chce?\",answer:\"Li\\u0161\\xED se produkt od produktu. N\\u011Bkter\\xE9 banky uv\\xE1d\\u011Bj\\xED konkr\\xE9tn\\xED po\\u010Det da\\u0148ov\\xFDch p\\u0159izn\\xE1n\\xED (nap\\u0159. KB ve\\u0159ejn\\u011B uv\\xE1d\\xED 2 roky u podnikatele); jinde sta\\u010D\\xED jin\\xE9 nastaven\\xED. U nov\\xE9 \\u017Eivnosti b\\xFDv\\xE1 kapacita ni\\u017E\\u0161\\xED nebo banka \\u017E\\xE1dost odm\\xEDtne.\"}],sources:[{label:\"KB \\u2014 \\u017D\\xE1dost o hypot\\xE9ku (doklady podnikatele)\",url:KB_HYPOTHEKA_APPLICATION},{label:\"KB \\u2014 Metodika hypote\\u010Dn\\xEDch \\xFAv\\u011Br\\u016F (PDF)\",url:KB_MORTGAGE_METHODOLOGY},{label:\"\\u010CNB \\u2014 makroobez\\u0159etnostn\\xED politika\",url:CNB_MACRO},{label:\"Metodika dat Hypot\\xE9ka Jasn\\u011B\",url:import_routes.routes.metodika},{label:\"Akademie: cesta OSV\\u010C\",url:`${import_routes.routes.akademie}/cesty`},{label:\"Redak\\u010Dn\\xED z\\xE1sady\",url:import_routes.routes.editorialPolicy}],relatedTools:[{label:\"Diagnostika OSV\\u010C\",href:`${import_routes.routes.mojeMoznosti}?intent=osvc`},{label:\"Ov\\u011B\\u0159en\\xE9 sazby\",href:import_routes.routes.sazby},{label:\"Nez\\xE1vazn\\xE1 popt\\xE1vka\",href:\"#poptavka\"}],relatedArticles:[{label:\"Hypot\\xE9ka podle p\\u0159\\xEDjmu\",href:`${import_routes.routes.temata}/hypoteka-podle-prijmu`}],relatedAcademy:[{label:\"DSTI\",href:`${import_routes.routes.akademie}/dsti`},{label:\"Cesta OSV\\u010C\",href:`${import_routes.routes.akademie}/cesty`}]},{slug:\"hypoteka-ze-zahranicniho-prijmu\",title:\"Hypot\\xE9ka se zahrani\\u010Dn\\xEDm p\\u0159\\xEDjmem | Hypot\\xE9ka Jasn\\u011B\",description:\"Financov\\xE1n\\xED \\u010Desk\\xE9 nemovitosti p\\u0159i p\\u0159\\xEDjmu ze zahrani\\u010D\\xED: dokumentace, m\\u011Bna, stabilita zam\\u011Bstn\\xE1n\\xED a pro\\u010D se banky li\\u0161\\xED. Jin\\xFD z\\xE1m\\u011Br ne\\u017E koup\\u011B nemovitosti v zahrani\\u010D\\xED.\",h1:\"Hypot\\xE9ka se zahrani\\u010Dn\\xEDm p\\u0159\\xEDjmem\",lead:\"M\\xE1te p\\u0159\\xEDjem mimo \\u010CR a kupujete nebo refinancujete nemovitost v \\u010Cesku? Banky posuzuj\\xED m\\u011Bnu, stabilitu zam\\u011Bstnavatele a dokumentaci jinak ne\\u017E u \\u010Dist\\u011B \\u010Desk\\xE9ho p\\u0159\\xEDjmu. Tento pr\\u016Fvodce vysv\\u011Btluje obecn\\xE9 principy \\u2014 ne slib schv\\xE1len\\xED.\",audience:\"Zam\\u011Bstnanci a podnikatel\\xE9 s p\\u0159\\xEDjmem ze zahrani\\u010D\\xED financuj\\xEDc\\xED bydlen\\xED v \\u010CR.\",authorId:\"redakce-hj\",publishedAt:\"2026-07-15\",updatedAt:\"2026-08-11\",commercialIntent:\"foreign_income\",primaryCta:{label:\"Prov\\u011B\\u0159it hypot\\xE9ku se zahrani\\u010Dn\\xEDm p\\u0159\\xEDjmem\",href:\"#poptavka\"},secondaryCta:{label:\"Orienta\\u010Dn\\xED diagnostika\",href:`${import_routes.routes.mojeMoznosti}?intent=foreign_income`},quickAnswer:{heading:\"Zahrani\\u010Dn\\xED p\\u0159\\xEDjem v kostce\",bullets:[\"Jde o financov\\xE1n\\xED nemovitosti v \\u010CR \\u2014 ne o koupi v zahrani\\u010D\\xED (viz /temata/hypoteka-v-zahranici).\",\"Konkr\\xE9tn\\xED doklady se li\\u0161\\xED podle banky, zem\\u011B, m\\u011Bny a typu p\\u0159\\xEDjmu.\",\"Pravidla pro rezidence a ob\\u010Danstv\\xED se li\\u0161\\xED \\u2014 bez konkr\\xE9tn\\xED banky je neobec\\u0148ujeme.\",\"Individu\\xE1ln\\xED posouzen\\xED je norm\\xE1ln\\xED; webov\\xFD model je jen orienta\\u010Dn\\xED.\"]},showLeadCapture:true,sections:[{id:\"prijem-mimo-cr\",heading:\"P\\u0159\\xEDjem mimo \\u010CR a zahrani\\u010Dn\\xED zam\\u011Bstnavatel\",paragraphs:[\"Typick\\xFD sc\\xE9n\\xE1\\u0159: pracujete pro firmu se s\\xEDdlem v EU, UK, USA nebo jinde, ale kupujete byt v \\u010Cesku. Banka mus\\xED ov\\u011B\\u0159it, \\u017Ee p\\u0159\\xEDjem je trval\\xFD, leg\\xE1ln\\xED a dostupn\\xFD pro spl\\xE1tky v CZK.\",\"N\\u011Bkter\\xE9 banky financuj\\xED zahrani\\u010Dn\\xED p\\u0159\\xEDjem b\\u011B\\u017En\\u011B, jin\\xE9 ho neberou v\\u016Fbec nebo jen u vybran\\xFDch zem\\xED a m\\u011Bn. Nen\\xED jednotn\\xFD seznam \\u201Eschv\\xE1len\\xFDch zem\\xED\\u201C platn\\xFD pro v\\u0161echny \\u2014 li\\u0161\\xED se produkt od produktu.\"]},{id:\"mena-a-fx\",heading:\"M\\u011Bna p\\u0159\\xEDjmu a kurzov\\xE9 riziko\",paragraphs:[\"P\\u0159\\xEDjem v EUR, USD nebo jin\\xE9 m\\u011Bn\\u011B banka obvykle p\\u0159epo\\u010Dte kurzem \\u2014 \\u010Dasto konzervativn\\xEDm. Nesete riziko, \\u017Ee pos\\xEDlen\\xED koruny sn\\xED\\u017E\\xED uznanou kapacitu, i kdy\\u017E v\\xE1m \\u201Ev kapse\\u201C nic nechyb\\xED.\",\"Modelujte rezervu na v\\xFDkyvy kurzu. Banka m\\u016F\\u017Ee po\\u017Eadovat spl\\xE1cen\\xED v CZK z \\u010Desk\\xE9ho \\xFA\\u010Dtu i p\\u0159i p\\u0159\\xEDjmu v ciz\\xED m\\u011Bn\\u011B.\"]},{id:\"dokumentace\",heading:\"Dokumentace \\u2014 bankov\\u011B specifick\\xE1\",paragraphs:[\"Konkr\\xE9tn\\xED doklady se li\\u0161\\xED podle banky, zem\\u011B, m\\u011Bny a typu p\\u0159\\xEDjmu. Neexistuje jeden univerz\\xE1ln\\xED seznam \\u201Epovinn\\xFD p\\u0159eklad + 6\\u201312 m\\u011Bs\\xEDc\\u016F v\\xFDpis\\u016F + ov\\u011B\\u0159en\\xED zam\\u011Bstnavatele + potvrzen\\xED o bezdlu\\u017Enosti\\u201C pro v\\u0161echny banky.\",\"P\\u0159ipravte se na del\\u0161\\xED schvalovac\\xED proces a ov\\u011B\\u0159te seznam u konkr\\xE9tn\\xED instituce d\\u0159\\xEDv, ne\\u017E slo\\u017E\\xEDte rezervaci.\"]},{id:\"priklady-bank-zahranicni\",heading:\"P\\u0159\\xEDklady zve\\u0159ejn\\u011Bn\\xFDch po\\u017Eadavk\\u016F bank\",paragraphs:[\"Komer\\u010Dn\\xED banka ve ve\\u0159ejn\\xE9 Metodice hypote\\u010Dn\\xEDch \\xFAv\\u011Br\\u016F popisuje zvl\\xE1\\u0161tn\\xED pravidla pro ob\\u010Dany \\u010CR s p\\u0159\\xEDjmem ze zahrani\\u010D\\xED. U \\u201Ependler\\u016F\\u201C ze sousedn\\xEDch zem\\xED i u p\\u0159\\xEDjmu z ostatn\\xEDch st\\xE1t\\u016F metodika uv\\xE1d\\xED nap\\u0159. potvrzen\\xED o v\\xFD\\u0161i pracovn\\xEDho p\\u0159\\xEDjmu, pracovn\\xED smlouvu a v\\xFDpisy z \\xFA\\u010Dtu, kam je mzda zas\\xEDl\\xE1na, za posledn\\xEDch 6 uplynul\\xFDch m\\u011Bs\\xEDc\\u016F. U cizojazy\\u010Dn\\xE9 smlouvy KB uv\\xE1d\\xED, \\u017Ee nemus\\xED j\\xEDt o \\xFA\\u0159edn\\xED p\\u0159eklad certifikovan\\xFDm p\\u0159ekladatelem \\u2014 kontroluj\\xED se vybran\\xE9 \\xFAdaje.\",\"Stejn\\xE1 metodika tak\\xE9 omezuje akceptaci: podnikatelsk\\xE1 \\u010Dinnost se zdrojem v zahrani\\u010D\\xED a dal\\u0161\\xED zahrani\\u010Dn\\xED p\\u0159\\xEDjmy (nap\\u0159. pron\\xE1jem) standardn\\u011B neakceptuje. Jde o pravidla KB \\u2014 jin\\xE9 banky mohou m\\xEDt jin\\xE9 seznamy doklad\\u016F i jin\\xE9 omezen\\xED.\"],bullets:[\"KB: specifick\\xE1 kapitola pro p\\u0159\\xEDjem ze zahrani\\u010D\\xED (pendler vs. ostatn\\xED st\\xE1ty).\",\"KB p\\u0159\\xEDklad: v\\xFDpisy 6 m\\u011Bs\\xEDc\\u016F u mzdy ze zahrani\\u010D\\xED \\u2014 ne univerz\\xE1ln\\xED tr\\u017En\\xED norma.\",\"UniCredit ve\\u0159ejn\\u011B popisuje cizom\\u011Bnovou hypot\\xE9ku (p\\u0159\\xEDjem v ciz\\xED m\\u011Bn\\u011B / bydli\\u0161t\\u011B mimo \\u010CR) a pr\\xE1vo na p\\u0159ed\\u010Dasn\\xE9 splacen\\xED p\\u0159i v\\xFDrazn\\xE9m pos\\xEDlen\\xED CZK \\u2014 podm\\xEDnky ov\\u011B\\u0159te na str\\xE1nce banky.\"]},{id:\"stabilita-zamestnani\",heading:\"Stabilita zam\\u011Bstn\\xE1n\\xED a historie\",paragraphs:[\"Banka hodnot\\xED d\\xE9lku pracovn\\xEDho pom\\u011Bru, zku\\u0161ebn\\xED dobu, typ smlouvy (do\\u010Dasn\\xE1 vs. na dobu neur\\u010Ditou) a stabilitu odv\\u011Btv\\xED zam\\u011Bstnavatele. \\u010Cast\\xE9 job-hopping nebo nov\\xE9 zam\\u011Bstn\\xE1n\\xED zvy\\u0161uje riziko odm\\xEDtnut\\xED.\",\"U OSV\\u010C se zahrani\\u010Dn\\xEDmi klienty plat\\xED podobn\\xE1 logika jako u \\u010Desk\\xE9 OSV\\u010C \\u2014 da\\u0148ov\\xE1 historie a ov\\u011B\\u0159itelnost p\\u0159\\xEDjm\\u016F rozhoduj\\xED, pokud banka takov\\xFD p\\u0159\\xEDjem v\\u016Fbec akceptuje.\"]},{id:\"financovani-v-cr\",heading:\"Financov\\xE1n\\xED \\u010Desk\\xE9 nemovitosti\",paragraphs:[\"Hypot\\xE9ka v \\u010CR se \\u0159\\xEDd\\xED \\u010Desk\\xFDm pr\\xE1vem, LTV limity \\u010CNB a metodikou banky. Zahrani\\u010Dn\\xED p\\u0159\\xEDjem nem\\u011Bn\\xED samotn\\xFD produkt \\u2014 m\\u011Bn\\xED posouzen\\xED bonity.\",\"LTV pro vlastn\\xED bydlen\\xED z\\u016Fst\\xE1v\\xE1 v r\\xE1mci makroobez\\u0159etnostn\\xEDch doporu\\u010Den\\xED \\u010CNB (typicky a\\u017E 80 %, u \\u017Eadatel\\u016F do 36 let za ur\\u010Dit\\xFDch podm\\xEDnek a\\u017E 90 %). DTI/DSTI pro standardn\\xED vlastn\\xED bydlen\\xED z\\u016Fst\\xE1vaj\\xED deaktivovan\\xE1 \\u2014 ov\\u011B\\u0159te aktu\\xE1ln\\xED stav u \\u010CNB.\"]},{id:\"proc-se-banky-lisi\",heading:\"Pro\\u010D se banky li\\u0161\\xED\",paragraphs:[\"Ka\\u017Ed\\xE1 banka m\\xE1 jin\\xFD apetit k riziku, seznam akceptovan\\xFDch zem\\xED, m\\u011Bn a typ\\u016F smluv. Co projde u jedn\\xE9 banky, nemus\\xED proj\\xEDt u druh\\xE9 \\u2014 nen\\xED to diskriminace klienta, ale intern\\xED pravidla.\",\"Hypote\\u010Dn\\xED specialista s p\\u0159\\xEDstupem k v\\xEDce bank\\xE1m pom\\xE1h\\xE1 z\\xFA\\u017Eit hled\\xE1n\\xED \\u2014 webov\\xE1 diagnostika jen orientuje, kam sm\\u011B\\u0159ovat ot\\xE1zky.\"]},{id:\"rezidence-a-obcanstvi\",heading:\"Rezidence a ob\\u010Danstv\\xED \\u2014 opatrn\\u011B\",paragraphs:[\"Bez konkr\\xE9tn\\xED banky neobec\\u0148ujeme: n\\u011Bkter\\xE9 produkty vy\\u017Eaduj\\xED trval\\xFD pobyt v \\u010CR, jin\\xE9 akceptuj\\xED cizince s povolen\\xEDm k pobytu. Ob\\u010Danstv\\xED EU m\\u016F\\u017Ee b\\xFDt v\\xFDhoda u n\\u011Bkter\\xFDch bank, u jin\\xFDch irelevantn\\xED.\",\"Individu\\xE1ln\\xED posouzen\\xED je zde norma. Pokud nem\\xE1te trval\\xFD pobyt v \\u010CR, kapacita bank m\\u016F\\u017Ee b\\xFDt omezen\\xE1 \\u2014 ov\\u011B\\u0159te d\\u0159\\xEDv, ne\\u017E slo\\u017E\\xEDte rezervaci.\"]},{id:\"jiny-zamer-nez-zahranici\",heading:\"Jin\\xFD z\\xE1m\\u011Br ne\\u017E hypot\\xE9ka v zahrani\\u010D\\xED\",paragraphs:[\"Tato str\\xE1nka \\u0159e\\u0161\\xED **p\\u0159\\xEDjem ze zahrani\\u010D\\xED pro nemovitost v \\u010CR**. Chcete-li koupit byt v Dubaji, \\u0160pan\\u011Blsku nebo jinde, jde o jin\\xFD z\\xE1m\\u011Br \\u2014 viz hub Hypot\\xE9ka v zahrani\\u010D\\xED na /temata/hypoteka-v-zahranici s dossier jednotliv\\xFDch zem\\xED.\",\"Nem\\xEDchejte oba z\\xE1m\\u011Bry v jedn\\xE9 \\u017E\\xE1dosti ani v SEO dotazech \\u2014 banka i vy pot\\u0159ebujete jinou dokumentaci a strukturu.\"]}],faqs:[{question:\"Financuje ka\\u017Ed\\xE1 banka p\\u0159\\xEDjem v EUR?\",answer:\"Ne. Akceptace m\\u011Bny a zem\\u011B z\\xE1vis\\xED na bance a produktu. Ov\\u011B\\u0159te u konkr\\xE9tn\\xED instituce, ne obecn\\u011B na internetu.\"},{question:\"Pot\\u0159ebuji trval\\xFD pobyt v \\u010CR?\",answer:\"Z\\xE1le\\u017E\\xED na bance a produktu. N\\u011Bkter\\xE9 hypot\\xE9ky vy\\u017Eaduj\\xED trval\\xFD pobyt nebo povolen\\xED k dlouhodob\\xE9mu pobytu. Bez konkr\\xE9tn\\xED banky nepl\\xE1nujte optimisticky.\"},{question:\"Je to tot\\xE9\\u017E jako koup\\u011B bytu v zahrani\\u010D\\xED?\",answer:\"Ne. Tato str\\xE1nka je pro p\\u0159\\xEDjem ze zahrani\\u010D\\xED a nemovitost v \\u010CR. Pro n\\xE1kup v zahrani\\u010D\\xED viz /temata/hypoteka-v-zahranici.\"},{question:\"Mus\\xEDm v\\u017Edy \\xFA\\u0159edn\\xED p\\u0159eklad a 6\\u201312 m\\u011Bs\\xEDc\\u016F v\\xFDpis\\u016F?\",answer:\"Ne univerz\\xE1ln\\u011B. Po\\u017Eadavky se li\\u0161\\xED banka od banky. Nap\\u0159. KB u cizojazy\\u010Dn\\xE9 smlouvy uv\\xE1d\\xED kontrolu vybran\\xFDch \\xFAdaj\\u016F bez nutnosti \\xFA\\u0159edn\\xEDho p\\u0159ekladu; u mzdy ze zahrani\\u010D\\xED v metodice uv\\xE1d\\xED v\\xFDpisy za 6 m\\u011Bs\\xEDc\\u016F. Jinde plat\\xED jin\\xFD seznam.\"},{question:\"M\\u016F\\u017Ee web sl\\xEDbit schv\\xE1len\\xED?\",answer:\"Ne. Diagnostika a pr\\u016Fvodce jsou edukace. Schv\\xE1len\\xED v\\u017Edy z\\xE1vis\\xED na bance, dokumentaci a scoringu.\"}],sources:[{label:\"KB \\u2014 Metodika hypote\\u010Dn\\xEDch \\xFAv\\u011Br\\u016F (p\\u0159\\xEDjem ze zahrani\\u010D\\xED)\",url:KB_MORTGAGE_METHODOLOGY},{label:\"UniCredit \\u2014 hypot\\xE9ka (cizom\\u011Bnov\\xE1 hypot\\xE9ka)\",url:\"https://www.unicreditbank.cz/cs/obcane/hypoteky/hypoteka-nove-penize.html\"},{label:\"\\u010CNB \\u2014 makroobez\\u0159etnostn\\xED politika\",url:CNB_MACRO},{label:\"Metodika dat Hypot\\xE9ka Jasn\\u011B\",url:import_routes.routes.metodika},{label:\"Hypot\\xE9ka v zahrani\\u010D\\xED (jin\\xFD z\\xE1m\\u011Br)\",url:`${import_routes.routes.temata}/hypoteka-v-zahranici`}],relatedTools:[{label:\"Orienta\\u010Dn\\xED diagnostika\",href:`${import_routes.routes.mojeMoznosti}?intent=foreign_income`},{label:\"Ov\\u011B\\u0159en\\xE9 sazby\",href:import_routes.routes.sazby},{label:\"Nez\\xE1vazn\\xE1 popt\\xE1vka\",href:\"#poptavka\"}],relatedArticles:[{label:\"Zahrani\\u010Dn\\xED financov\\xE1n\\xED a \\u010Desk\\xE9 zaji\\u0161t\\u011Bn\\xED\",href:`${import_routes.routes.clanky}/zahranicni-financovani-ceske-zajisteni`}],relatedAcademy:[{label:\"LTV\",href:`${import_routes.routes.akademie}/ltv`},{label:\"DSTI\",href:`${import_routes.routes.akademie}/dsti`}]},{slug:\"investicni-hypoteka\",title:\"Investi\\u010Dn\\xED hypot\\xE9ka: pravidla, LTV a v\\xFDpo\\u010Det | Hypot\\xE9ka Jasn\\u011B\",description:\"Co je investi\\u010Dn\\xED hypot\\xE9ka podle \\u010CNB, doporu\\u010Den\\xED LTV 70 % a DTI 7 od dubna 2026 a jak modelovat investici. Vazba na Investi\\u010Dn\\xED rentgen \\u2014 bez slib\\u016F schv\\xE1len\\xED.\",h1:\"Investi\\u010Dn\\xED hypot\\xE9ka\",lead:\"Investi\\u010Dn\\xED hypot\\xE9ka nen\\xED \\u201Estejn\\xFD \\xFAv\\u011Br s jin\\xFDm \\xFA\\u010Delem\\u201C. \\u010CNB od 1. dubna 2026 doporu\\u010Duje p\\u0159\\xEDsn\\u011Bj\\u0161\\xED limity pro definovan\\xE9 investi\\u010Dn\\xED \\xFAv\\u011Bry \\u2014 a banky posuzuj\\xED n\\xE1jemn\\xED p\\u0159\\xEDjem konzervativn\\u011Bji ne\\u017E plat ze zam\\u011Bstn\\xE1n\\xED.\",audience:\"Investo\\u0159i do n\\xE1jemn\\xEDho bydlen\\xED v \\u010CR a lid\\xE9 po\\u0159izuj\\xEDc\\xED t\\u0159et\\xED a dal\\u0161\\xED obytnou nemovitost.\",authorId:\"redakce-hj\",publishedAt:\"2026-07-15\",updatedAt:\"2026-08-11\",commercialIntent:\"investment\",primaryCta:{label:\"Prov\\u011B\\u0159it financov\\xE1n\\xED investice\",href:\"#poptavka\"},secondaryCta:{label:\"Spustit Investi\\u010Dn\\xED rentgen\",href:import_routes.routes.investicniRentgen},quickAnswer:{heading:\"Investi\\u010Dn\\xED hypot\\xE9ka v kostce\",bullets:[`\\u010CNB definice: \\u201E${CNB_INVESTMENT_DEFINITION}\"`,\"Od 1. 4. 2026: \\u010CNB doporu\\u010Duje poskytovatel\\u016Fm u definovan\\xFDch investi\\u010Dn\\xEDch hypot\\xE9k obez\\u0159etn\\u011Bj\\u0161\\xED horn\\xED hranici LTV 70 % a DTI 7 (nejde o z\\xE1konn\\xFD strop pro vlastn\\xED bydlen\\xED).\",\"Vlastn\\xED bydlen\\xED: LTV 80 % (do 36 let za podm\\xEDnek 90 %) \\u2014 DTI/DSTI pro standardn\\xED FO deaktivovan\\xE1.\",\"Investi\\u010Dn\\xED rentgen pom\\xE1h\\xE1 modelovat sc\\xE9n\\xE1\\u0159 \\u2014 ne garantuje \\xFAv\\u011Br.\"]},showLeadCapture:true,sections:[{id:\"definice-cnb\",heading:\"Definice investi\\u010Dn\\xED hypot\\xE9ky podle \\u010CNB\",paragraphs:[`\\u010Cesk\\xE1 n\\xE1rodn\\xED banka v tiskov\\xE9 zpr\\xE1v\\u011B uv\\xE1d\\xED: \\u201E${CNB_INVESTMENT_DEFINITION}\"`,\"Nejde tedy automaticky o \\u201Edruhou nemovitost\\u201C obecn\\u011B \\u2014 rozhoduje \\xFA\\u010Del (t\\u0159et\\xED a dal\\u0161\\xED obytn\\xE1 nemovitost nebo nemovitost ur\\u010Den\\xE1 k pron\\xE1jmu). Druh\\xFD byt k vlastn\\xEDmu bydlen\\xED nemus\\xED spadat pod investi\\u010Dn\\xED definici \\u2014 posoud\\xED banka a \\xFA\\u010Del \\xFAv\\u011Bru.\"]},{id:\"limity-2026\",heading:\"Doporu\\u010Den\\xED \\u010CNB od 1. dubna 2026\",paragraphs:[\"\\u010CNB doporu\\u010Duje poskytovatel\\u016Fm u definovan\\xFDch investi\\u010Dn\\xEDch hypot\\xE9k obez\\u0159etn\\u011Bj\\u0161\\xED horn\\xED hranici LTV 70 % a DTI 7, s \\xFA\\u010Dinnost\\xED doporu\\u010Den\\xED od 1. dubna 2026. Kapitalov\\xE9 rezervy bank se podle tiskov\\xE9 zpr\\xE1vy nem\\u011Bn\\xED. Nejde o z\\xE1konn\\xFD strop LTV pro vlastn\\xED bydlen\\xED.\",\"Pro standardn\\xED hypot\\xE9ku na vlastn\\xED bydlen\\xED z\\u016Fst\\xE1vaj\\xED doporu\\u010Den\\xE9 limity LTV 80 % (u \\u017Eadatel\\u016F do 36 let za ur\\u010Dit\\xFDch podm\\xEDnek a\\u017E 90 %). Makroobez\\u0159etnostn\\xED limity DTI a DSTI pro b\\u011B\\u017En\\xE9 hypot\\xE9ky fyzick\\xFDch osob na vlastn\\xED bydlen\\xED z\\u016Fst\\xE1vaj\\xED deaktivovan\\xE9 \\u2014 stav ov\\u011B\\u0159te u prim\\xE1rn\\xEDho zdroje \\u010CNB.\"],bullets:[\"Investi\\u010Dn\\xED \\xFA\\u010Del dle \\u010CNB \\u2192 doporu\\u010Den\\xE1 obez\\u0159etn\\u011Bj\\u0161\\xED horn\\xED hranice LTV 70 % a DTI 7 (od 4/2026).\",\"Vlastn\\xED bydlen\\xED \\u2192 jin\\xFD r\\xE1mec LTV; DTI/DSTI deaktivovan\\xE1 pro standardn\\xED FO.\",\"Prim\\xE1rn\\xED zdroj: tiskov\\xE1 zpr\\xE1va a makroobez\\u0159etnostn\\xED politika \\u010CNB.\"]},{id:\"rozdil-vuci-bydleni\",heading:\"Rozd\\xEDl oproti hypot\\xE9ce na vlastn\\xED bydlen\\xED\",paragraphs:[\"U investice banka pou\\u017E\\xEDv\\xE1 vlastn\\xED intern\\xED test schopnosti spl\\xE1cet a m\\u016F\\u017Ee n\\xE1jemn\\xED p\\u0159\\xEDjem zapo\\u010D\\xEDt\\xE1vat konzervativn\\u011B (\\u010D\\xE1ste\\u010Dn\\u011B / s haircutem). \\u010Casto vy\\u017Eaduje vy\\u0161\\u0161\\xED akontaci. Marketing \\u201Ecash-flow od prvn\\xEDho dne\\u201C ignoruje neobsazenost, spr\\xE1vu, da\\u0148 a r\\u016Fst sazeb po fixaci.\",\"Plo\\u0161n\\xFD regula\\u010Dn\\xED limit DSTI \\u010CNB pro b\\u011B\\u017En\\xE9 hypot\\xE9ky na vlastn\\xED bydlen\\xED z\\u016Fst\\xE1v\\xE1 deaktivovan\\xFD \\u2014 u investice se proto nespol\\xE9hejte na \\u201Eaktu\\xE1ln\\xED DSTI limit \\u010CNB\\u201C, ale na intern\\xED praxi banky a doporu\\u010Den\\xE9 LTV/DTI pro investi\\u010Dn\\xED \\xFAv\\u011Bry. Ka\\u017Ed\\xE1 dal\\u0161\\xED investi\\u010Dn\\xED nemovitost sni\\u017Euje zb\\xFDvaj\\xEDc\\xED kapacitu \\u2014 pl\\xE1nujte equity dop\\u0159edu.\"]},{id:\"investicni-rentgen\",heading:\"Investi\\u010Dn\\xED rentgen jako modelovac\\xED n\\xE1stroj\",paragraphs:[\"Investi\\u010Dn\\xED rentgen na /investicni-rentgen pom\\xE1h\\xE1 srovnat sc\\xE9n\\xE1\\u0159e, trhy a citlivost na sazby \\u2014 nen\\xED n\\xE1hradou bankovn\\xEDho posouzen\\xED ani slibem schv\\xE1len\\xED.\",\"Pro rozhodnut\\xED \\u201Ekoupit / nekoupit\\u201C pot\\u0159ebujete konzervativn\\xED model v\\u010Detn\\u011B neobsazenosti a re\\u017Eijn\\xEDch n\\xE1klad\\u016F, ne nejlep\\u0161\\xED m\\u011Bs\\xEDc z inzer\\xE1tu.\"]},{id:\"regulace-clanek\",heading:\"Regulace a podp\\u016Frn\\xFD \\u010Dl\\xE1nek\",paragraphs:[\"Podrobn\\u011Bj\\u0161\\xED kontext k doporu\\u010Den\\xEDm \\u010CNB a praxi bank najdete v \\u010Dl\\xE1nku Regulace a investi\\u010Dn\\xED hypot\\xE9ky v \\u010CR. \\u010Cl\\xE1nek dopl\\u0148uje tiskovou zpr\\xE1vu, nenahrazuje ji.\",\"Pravidla se vyv\\xEDjej\\xED \\u2014 v\\u017Edy ov\\u011B\\u0159te aktu\\xE1ln\\xED zn\\u011Bn\\xED u \\u010CNB p\\u0159ed z\\xE1vazn\\xFDm rozhodnut\\xEDm.\"]},{id:\"co-banka-posuzuje\",heading:\"Co banka posuzuje u investi\\u010Dn\\xEDho \\xFAv\\u011Bru\",paragraphs:[\"Krom\\u011B LTV a DTI vstupuje p\\u0159\\xEDjem z n\\xE1jmu (s haircutem), st\\xE1vaj\\xEDc\\xED portfolio nemovitost\\xED, z\\xE1vazky dom\\xE1cnosti a bonita ru\\u010Ditele. Firemn\\xED struktura (s.r.o.) m\\u016F\\u017Ee otev\\u0159\\xEDt jin\\xFD produkt, ale nen\\xED automatick\\xFDm obch\\xE1zen\\xEDm limit\\u016F FO.\",\"Webov\\xFD odhad kapacity nen\\xED nab\\xEDdka. Banka m\\xE1 intern\\xED v\\xFDjimky a scoring.\"]},{id:\"dalsi-krok\",heading:\"Dal\\u0161\\xED krok\",paragraphs:[\"Spus\\u0165te Investi\\u010Dn\\xED rentgen pro orienta\\u010Dn\\xED model, pak diagnostiku mo\\u017Enost\\xED. Teprve s \\u010D\\xEDsly v ruce d\\xE1v\\xE1 smysl jednat s bankou nebo hypote\\u010Dn\\xEDm specialistou.\"]}],faqs:[{question:\"Plat\\xED LTV 70 % pro ka\\u017Edou druhou nemovitost?\",answer:\"Ne automaticky. \\u010CNB v\\xE1zat limity na investi\\u010Dn\\xED hypot\\xE9ku dle definice (t\\u0159et\\xED a dal\\u0161\\xED obytn\\xE1 nemovitost nebo \\xFA\\u010Del pron\\xE1jmu). Druh\\xFD byt k vlastn\\xEDmu bydlen\\xED nemus\\xED spadat pod investi\\u010Dn\\xED r\\xE1mec \\u2014 posoud\\xED banka.\"},{question:\"Zaplat\\xED n\\xE1jem celou spl\\xE1tku?\",answer:\"Ne v\\u017Edy. Modelujte neobsazenost, da\\u0148 a spr\\xE1vu. Banka nav\\xEDc nemus\\xED zapo\\u010D\\xEDtat n\\xE1jem 1:1.\"},{question:\"Kdy vstoup\\xED limity DTI 7?\",answer:\"Dle tiskov\\xE9 zpr\\xE1vy \\u010CNB od 1. dubna 2026 u investi\\u010Dn\\xEDch hypot\\xE9k podle definice \\u010CNB. Ov\\u011B\\u0159te aktu\\xE1ln\\xED stav u prim\\xE1rn\\xEDho zdroje.\"},{question:\"Nahrad\\xED rentgen n\\xE1v\\u0161t\\u011Bvu banky?\",answer:\"Ne. Rentgen je eduka\\u010Dn\\xED model. Schv\\xE1len\\xED a podm\\xEDnky v\\u017Edy ur\\u010Duje banka.\"}],sources:[{label:\"\\u010CNB \\u2014 tiskov\\xE1 zpr\\xE1va k investi\\u010Dn\\xEDm hypot\\xE9k\\xE1m\",url:CNB_INVESTMENT_PRESS},{label:\"\\u010CNB \\u2014 makroobez\\u0159etnostn\\xED politika\",url:CNB_MACRO},{label:\"Regulace a investi\\u010Dn\\xED hypot\\xE9ky v \\u010CR\",url:`${import_routes.routes.clanky}/regulace-investicni-hypoteky-cr`},{label:\"Investi\\u010Dn\\xED rentgen\",url:import_routes.routes.investicniRentgen}],relatedTools:[{label:\"Investi\\u010Dn\\xED rentgen\",href:import_routes.routes.investicniRentgen},{label:\"Osobn\\xED investi\\u010Dn\\xED pr\\u016Fvodce\",href:import_routes.routes.investicniPas},{label:\"Ov\\u011B\\u0159en\\xE9 sazby\",href:import_routes.routes.sazby}],relatedArticles:[{label:\"Regulace a investi\\u010Dn\\xED hypot\\xE9ky v \\u010CR\",href:`${import_routes.routes.clanky}/regulace-investicni-hypoteky-cr`}],relatedAcademy:[{label:\"LTV\",href:`${import_routes.routes.akademie}/ltv`},{label:\"DTI\",href:`${import_routes.routes.akademie}/dti`}]},{slug:\"americka-hypoteka\",title:\"Americk\\xE1 hypot\\xE9ka: jak funguje a co stoj\\xED | Hypot\\xE9ka Jasn\\u011B\",description:\"Ne\\xFA\\u010Delov\\xFD \\xFAv\\u011Br zaji\\u0161t\\u011Bn\\xFD nemovitost\\xED vs. klasick\\xE1 hypot\\xE9ka: rizika z\\xE1stavy, LTV a sazby. Produktov\\u011B specifick\\xE1 data z ofici\\xE1ln\\xEDch zdroj\\u016F bank \\u2014 bez z\\xE1m\\u011Bny se sazbami na koupi bydlen\\xED.\",h1:\"Americk\\xE1 hypot\\xE9ka\",lead:\"Americk\\xE1 hypot\\xE9ka v \\u010Desk\\xE9m prost\\u0159ed\\xED znamen\\xE1 ne\\xFA\\u010Delov\\xFD \\xFAv\\u011Br zaji\\u0161t\\u011Bn\\xFD nemovitost\\xED \\u2014 pen\\xEDze nemus\\xEDte prokazat\\u011B investovat do bydlen\\xED. Jin\\xE9 riziko, jin\\xE9 sazby, jin\\xE1 pravidla ne\\u017E u klasick\\xE9 hypot\\xE9ky.\",audience:\"Vlastn\\xEDci nemovitosti hledaj\\xEDc\\xED ne\\xFA\\u010Delov\\xE9 financov\\xE1n\\xED zaji\\u0161t\\u011Bn\\xE9 bytem nebo domem.\",authorId:\"redakce-hj\",publishedAt:\"2026-07-15\",updatedAt:\"2026-08-11\",commercialIntent:\"american\",primaryCta:{label:\"Prov\\u011B\\u0159it americkou hypot\\xE9ku\",href:\"#poptavka\"},secondaryCta:{label:\"P\\u0159\\xEDklady zve\\u0159ejn\\u011Bn\\xFDch podm\\xEDnek\",href:\"#priklady-bank-americka\"},quickAnswer:{heading:\"Americk\\xE1 hypot\\xE9ka v kostce\",bullets:[\"Ne\\xFA\\u010Delov\\xFD \\xFAv\\u011Br zaji\\u0161t\\u011Bn\\xFD nemovitost\\xED \\u2014 jin\\xFD produkt ne\\u017E klasick\\xE1 hypot\\xE9ka.\",\"P\\u0159i nespl\\xE1cen\\xED hroz\\xED realizace z\\xE1stavy \\u2014 riziko je vy\\u0161\\u0161\\xED ne\\u017E u b\\u011B\\u017En\\xE9 spot\\u0159ebitelsk\\xE9 p\\u016Fj\\u010Dky.\",\"LTV a sazby jsou produktov\\u011B specifick\\xE9; nepl\\xE9st se sazbami na koupi bydlen\\xED.\",\"U \\u010D\\xE1sti bank sazbu pr\\xE1v\\u011B ov\\u011B\\u0159ujeme \\u2014 neuv\\xE1d\\xEDme nepodlo\\u017Een\\xE9 srovn\\xE1n\\xED.\"]},showLeadCapture:true,sections:[{id:\"co-je-americka\",heading:\"Co je americk\\xE1 hypot\\xE9ka\",paragraphs:[\"V \\u010CR se pod t\\xEDmto n\\xE1zvem obvykle rozum\\xED ne\\xFA\\u010Delov\\xFD \\xFAv\\u011Br zaji\\u0161t\\u011Bn\\xFD z\\xE1stavn\\xEDm pr\\xE1vem k nemovitosti. Prost\\u0159edky nemus\\xEDte prokazat\\u011B pou\\u017E\\xEDt na koupi bytu \\u2014 na rozd\\xEDl od klasick\\xE9 hypot\\xE9ky na bydlen\\xED.\",\"N\\xE1zev evokuje americk\\xFD model mortgage, ale produktov\\xE9 podm\\xEDnky jsou \\u010Desk\\xE9. Srovn\\xE1vejte smlouvu, ne marketingov\\xFD n\\xE1zev.\"]},{id:\"vs-klasicka\",heading:\"Rozd\\xEDl oproti klasick\\xE9 hypot\\xE9ce\",paragraphs:[\"Klasick\\xE1 hypot\\xE9ka na bydlen\\xED je \\xFA\\u010Delov\\u011B v\\xE1zan\\xE1 \\u2014 banka sleduje \\xFA\\u010Del a \\u010Dasto p\\u0159\\xEDsn\\u011Bji posuzuje LTV i p\\u0159\\xEDjem. Americk\\xE1 / ne\\xFA\\u010Delov\\xE1 hypot\\xE9ka m\\u016F\\u017Ee m\\xEDt vy\\u0161\\u0161\\xED sazbu, ni\\u017E\\u0161\\xED LTV nebo krat\\u0161\\xED splatnost.\",\"Sazby zve\\u0159ejn\\u011Bn\\xE9 pro koupi bydlen\\xED na /sazby nejsou sazby americk\\xE9 hypot\\xE9ky. Produkt je jin\\xFD \\u2014 neporovn\\xE1vejte je.\"]},{id:\"rizika-zastavy\",heading:\"Rizika z\\xE1stavy nemovitosti\",paragraphs:[\"Nespl\\xE1c\\xEDte-li \\xFAv\\u011Br, banka m\\u016F\\u017Ee realizovat z\\xE1stavu. Riziko ztr\\xE1ty nemovitosti je re\\xE1ln\\xE9 \\u2014 ne\\xFA\\u010Delov\\xFD \\xFAv\\u011Br proto nesm\\xED b\\xFDt br\\xE1n jako \\u201Elevn\\u011Bj\\u0161\\xED kontokorent\\u201C.\",\"Modelujte spl\\xE1tku v\\u010Detn\\u011B r\\u016Fstu sazby po fixaci a m\\u011Bjte rezervu. Orienta\\u010Dn\\xED spl\\xE1tkov\\xE9 n\\xE1stroje na webu vych\\xE1zej\\xED z klasick\\xE9 hypot\\xE9ky \\u2014 u americk\\xE9 hypot\\xE9ky berte zve\\u0159ejn\\u011Bn\\xE9 produktov\\xE9 podm\\xEDnky banky, ne obecn\\xFD model.\"],bullets:[\"Z\\xE1stava = v\\xE1\\u017En\\xE9 riziko, ne formalita.\",\"Splatnost a fixace ovliv\\u0148uj\\xED celkovou cenu.\",\"P\\u0159ed\\u010Dasn\\xE9 splacen\\xED m\\u016F\\u017Ee m\\xEDt sankce \\u2014 \\u010Dt\\u011Bte smlouvu.\"]},{id:\"priklady-bank-americka\",heading:\"P\\u0159\\xEDklady zve\\u0159ejn\\u011Bn\\xFDch podm\\xEDnek bank\",paragraphs:[\"N\\xED\\u017Ee jsou ov\\u011B\\u0159en\\xE9 \\xFAdaje z ofici\\xE1ln\\xEDch str\\xE1nek bank (stav kontroly 11. 8. 2026). Nejde o individu\\xE1ln\\xED nab\\xEDdku ani o kompletn\\xED srovn\\xE1va\\u010D \\u2014 jen o to, co banka ve\\u0159ejn\\u011B uv\\xE1d\\xED.\",\"Komer\\u010Dn\\xED banka (produktov\\xE1 str\\xE1nka Americk\\xE1 hypot\\xE9ka): sazba od 5,59 % p. a., LTV a\\u017E 70 % ceny nemovitosti, splatnost a\\u017E 20 let. Reprezentativn\\xED p\\u0159\\xEDklad na str\\xE1nce pou\\u017E\\xEDv\\xE1 pevnou sazbu 5,59 % p. a. s fixac\\xED 3 roky.\",\"MONETA Money Bank (produktov\\xE1 str\\xE1nka): ne\\xFA\\u010Delov\\xFD \\xFAv\\u011Br zaji\\u0161t\\u011Bn\\xFD nemovitost\\xED, LTV a\\u017E 70 % odhadn\\xED ceny, v\\xFD\\u0161e od 300 000 K\\u010D, splatnost a\\u017E 20 let; str\\xE1nka uv\\xE1d\\xED sazbu od 4,79 % ro\\u010Dn\\u011B. Konkr\\xE9tn\\xED sazbu dle fixace ov\\u011B\\u0159te v aktu\\xE1ln\\xEDm \\xFArokov\\xE9m l\\xEDstku banky.\",\"UniCredit Bank na ofici\\xE1ln\\xEDm sazebn\\xEDku zve\\u0159ej\\u0148uje samostatn\\xFD sloupec Hypot\\xE9ka ne\\xFA\\u010Delov\\xE1 (odli\\u0161n\\xFD od \\xFA\\u010Delov\\xE9 hypot\\xE9ky): nap\\u0159. fixace 2 roky od 5,09 %, 3 roky od 5,19 %, 5 let od 5,59 % \\u2014 sazby plat\\xED p\\u0159i poji\\u0161t\\u011Bn\\xED schopnosti spl\\xE1cet a aktivit\\u011B na \\xFA\\u010Dtu dle podm\\xEDnek banky.\",\"\\u010Cesk\\xE1 spo\\u0159itelna na produktov\\xE9 str\\xE1nce uv\\xE1d\\xED LTV a\\u017E 70 % odhadn\\xED ceny a splatnost a\\u017E 20 let. Konkr\\xE9tn\\xED zve\\u0159ejn\\u011Bnou sazbu t\\xE9to banky pro americkou hypot\\xE9ku pr\\xE1v\\u011B ov\\u011B\\u0159ujeme \\u2014 neuv\\xE1d\\xEDme ji jako srovnatelnou nab\\xEDdku.\"],bullets:[\"KB: od 5,59 % p. a.; LTV a\\u017E 70 %; splatnost a\\u017E 20 let.\",\"MONETA: od 4,79 % p. a. (headline); LTV a\\u017E 70 %; splatnost a\\u017E 20 let.\",\"UniCredit: samostatn\\xE1 ne\\xFA\\u010Delov\\xE1 sazba dle fixace (viz sazebn\\xEDk).\",\"\\u010CS: LTV/splatnost zve\\u0159ejn\\u011Bny; sazbu pr\\xE1v\\u011B ov\\u011B\\u0159ujeme.\"]},{id:\"ltv-a-sazby\",heading:\"LTV a sazby \\u2014 produktov\\u011B specifick\\xE9\",paragraphs:[\"LTV u americk\\xE9 / ne\\xFA\\u010Delov\\xE9 hypot\\xE9ky b\\xFDv\\xE1 ni\\u017E\\u0161\\xED ne\\u017E u standardn\\xED hypot\\xE9ky na bydlen\\xED. Konkr\\xE9tn\\xED limity bereme jen z ofici\\xE1ln\\xEDho zdroje banky \\u2014 neinferujeme je ze sazeb na koupi.\",\"U \\u010D\\xE1sti bank sazbu pr\\xE1v\\u011B ov\\u011B\\u0159ujeme. Dokud nem\\xE1me dostate\\u010Dn\\u011B dolo\\u017Eenou produktov\\u011B specifickou sazbu, neuve\\u0159ej\\u0148ujeme fale\\u0161n\\xE9 srovn\\xE1n\\xED ani sazby z klasick\\xE9 hypot\\xE9ky na bydlen\\xED.\"]},{id:\"kdy-dava-smysl\",heading:\"Kdy m\\u016F\\u017Ee d\\xE1vat smysl \\u2014 a kdy ne\",paragraphs:[\"Typick\\xE9 sc\\xE9n\\xE1\\u0159e: konsolidace dra\\u017E\\u0161\\xEDch \\xFAv\\u011Br\\u016F p\\u0159i dostate\\u010Dn\\xE9 equity, podnikatelsk\\xE1 pot\\u0159eba s jasn\\xFDm pl\\xE1nem spl\\xE1cen\\xED, kr\\xE1tkodob\\xE9 p\\u0159eklenut\\xED s exit strategi\\xED.\",\"Nevhodn\\xE9: financovat spot\\u0159ebu bez pl\\xE1nu spl\\xE1cen\\xED, maximalizovat LTV na hranici, spol\\xE9hat na prodej nemovitosti \\u201Ea\\u017E to bude nutn\\xE9\\u201C.\"]},{id:\"co-banka-chce\",heading:\"Co banka typicky posuzuje\",paragraphs:[\"Odhad nemovitosti, LTV, p\\u0159\\xEDjem a z\\xE1vazky, st\\xE1vaj\\xEDc\\xED z\\xE1stavy, bonita a \\xFA\\u010Del (i u ne\\xFA\\u010Delov\\xE9ho \\xFAv\\u011Bru banka m\\u016F\\u017Ee pt\\xE1t na pl\\xE1n). Scoring americk\\xE9 hypot\\xE9ky m\\u016F\\u017Ee b\\xFDt p\\u0159\\xEDsn\\u011Bj\\u0161\\xED ne\\u017E u hypot\\xE9ky na bydlen\\xED.\",\"Dokumentace se bl\\xED\\u017E\\xED standardn\\xED hypot\\xE9ce \\u2014 rozd\\xEDl je v produktu a cen\\u011B pen\\u011Bz.\"]},{id:\"vzdelani-akademie\",heading:\"Vzd\\u011Bl\\xE1n\\xED v akademii\",paragraphs:[\"Pro hlub\\u0161\\xED vysv\\u011Btlen\\xED produktu nav\\u0161tivte lekci Americk\\xE1 hypot\\xE9ka v akademii. Edukace nenahrazuje individu\\xE1ln\\xED nab\\xEDdku banky.\",\"Sazby koup\\u011B bydlen\\xED na /sazby sem nepat\\u0159\\xED \\u2014 americk\\xE1 hypot\\xE9ka je samostatn\\xFD produkt.\"]},{id:\"dalsi-krok\",heading:\"Dal\\u0161\\xED krok\",paragraphs:[\"Spo\\u010D\\xEDtejte si rezervu a srovnejte zve\\u0159ejn\\u011Bn\\xE9 podm\\xEDnky bank v\\xFD\\u0161e. U americk\\xE9 hypot\\xE9ky je individu\\xE1ln\\xED posouzen\\xED banky obzvl\\xE1\\u0161\\u0165 d\\u016Fle\\u017Eit\\xE9 \\u2014 web v\\xE1m pom\\u016F\\u017Ee s r\\xE1mcem, ne se smlouvou.\"]}],faqs:[{question:\"Je americk\\xE1 hypot\\xE9ka tot\\xE9\\u017E co hypot\\xE9ka na bydlen\\xED?\",answer:\"Ne. Jde o ne\\xFA\\u010Delov\\xFD \\xFAv\\u011Br zaji\\u0161t\\u011Bn\\xFD nemovitost\\xED s jin\\xFDmi podm\\xEDnkami a obvykle jinou sazbou.\"},{question:\"Mohu pou\\u017E\\xEDt sazby z /sazby pro koupi?\",answer:\"Ne pro americkou hypot\\xE9ku. Sazby na /sazby jsou pro standardn\\xED hypot\\xE9ky; americk\\xE1 hypot\\xE9ka je jin\\xFD produkt.\"},{question:\"Jak\\xE9 LTV banka poskytne?\",answer:\"Z\\xE1le\\u017E\\xED na bance, nemovitosti a bonit\\u011B. N\\u011Bkter\\xE9 banky ve\\u0159ejn\\u011B uv\\xE1d\\u011Bj\\xED nap\\u0159. a\\u017E 70 % (KB, MONETA, \\u010CS) \\u2014 bez individu\\xE1ln\\xED nab\\xEDdky nepl\\xE1nujte optimisticky.\"},{question:\"M\\xE1te sazby v\\u0161ech bank?\",answer:\"Ne. U \\u010D\\xE1sti bank sazbu pr\\xE1v\\u011B ov\\u011B\\u0159ujeme. Zve\\u0159ej\\u0148ujeme jen to, co je dolo\\u017Een\\xE9 ofici\\xE1ln\\xEDm zdrojem konkr\\xE9tn\\xED banky \\u2014 nikdy sazby z klasick\\xE9 hypot\\xE9ky na bydlen\\xED.\"}],sources:[{label:\"KB \\u2014 Americk\\xE1 hypot\\xE9ka (produktov\\xE1 str\\xE1nka)\",url:KB_AMERICAN_PRODUCT},{label:\"MONETA \\u2014 Americk\\xE1 hypot\\xE9ka\",url:MONETA_AMERICAN_PRODUCT},{label:\"UniCredit \\u2014 \\xFArokov\\xE9 sazby (Hypot\\xE9ka ne\\xFA\\u010Delov\\xE1)\",url:UC_RATE_SHEET},{label:\"\\u010CS \\u2014 Americk\\xE1 hypot\\xE9ka\",url:CS_AMERICAN_PRODUCT},{label:\"Akademie: Americk\\xE1 hypot\\xE9k